    "**Table 28 — All LDA errors involving transitions.** Five true-transition mistakes comprise **three transition-to-common** and **two transition-to-transition** errors; four belong to participant 24. One additional false alarm is LAYING → STAND_TO_LIE. Test rows are zero-based, not timestamps or event IDs.\n"
